# OpenStreetMap — free Nominatim (name search) + Overpass (nearby)
# No API key required for public endpoints. Follow usage policies:
# - Nominatim: https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/nominatim/
# - Provide a descriptive User-Agent (required).
# - Keep request volume modest (about 1 req/sec for public Nominatim).
#
# Optional overrides (defaults work for local/dev):
# OSM_USER_AGENT=EBClaimsMerchantLocator/1.0 (your-email@example.com)
# OSM_NOMINATIM_URL=https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search
# OSM_OVERPASS_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter
